FuchsiaCity_Text_Camper::
	.string "One of the ELITE FOUR used to be\n"
	.string "the LEADER of FUCHSIA’s GYM.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Woman2::
	.string "The SAFARI ZONE finally has\n"
	.string "reopened.\p"
	.string "I’m glad, because it’s FUCHSIA’s\n"
	.string "main attraction.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_BaldingMan::
	.string "KOGA’s daughter succeeded him as\n"
	.string "the GYM LEADER after he joined\l"
	.string "the ELITE FOUR.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree::
	.string "How can this tree be CUT if you don’t\n"
	.string "have any POKéMON?$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree2_1::
	.string "What to do...?$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree2_2::
	.string "???: Are you in trouble kid?$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree2_3::
	.string "KOGA: Is that you {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "Why are you stuck there?\n"
	.string "Don’t you have any POKéMON with\l"
	.string "CUT with you?\l"
	.string "Then how did you...?$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree2_4::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "KOGA: What? Your POKéMON had been\n"
	.string "stolen by TEAM ROCKET?\p"
	.string "Those rats...\p"
	.string "They must be punished.\p"
	.string "Just hang there a second {PLAYER}.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree2_5::
	.string "KOGA’s ROSELIA uses CUT.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree2_6::
	.string "KOGA: Now, let me use my ninja\n"
	.string "powers to sense their trace...$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_CutTree2_7::
	.string "KOGA: I see... They went towards\n"
	.string "ROUTE 15.\p"
	.string "Follow me, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "We must hurry!$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Trigger4::
	.string "Must think of a way to recover the\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Sign1::
	.string "There’s a notice here...\p"
	.string "Come to the SAFARI ZONE!\n"
	.string "Now with more POKéMON!$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Sign2::
	.string "FUCHSIA CITY\n"
	.string "Behold! It’s Passion Pink!$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Sign3::
	.string "FUCHSIA CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
	.string "LEADER: JANINE\l"
	.string "The Poisonous Ninja Master$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Sign4::
	.string "SAFARI ZONE WARDEN’S HOME$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Sign5::
	.string "FUCHSIA’s SAFARI ZONE.\n"
	.string "Now open!$"

FuchsiaCity_Text_Sign7::
	.string "No littering.\n"
	.string "Please take your waste with you.$"
